Third-party assets

**Magnetik is bundled** in `src/lib/fonts/` (Regular, Medium, Bold, woff2). It is not covered
by the MIT licence above.

- **Magnetik** by Alfredo Marco Pradil, Hanken Design Co. Copyright © 2023, all rights reserved.
  Commercial font, licensed by Facile Studio for web use on the Facile suite's sites
  (owner decision, 2026-11-13). Terms: https://hanken.co/eula
  Use outside a Facile Studio product needs your own licence from https://hanken.co

**Icon artwork is bundled** in `src/lib/icons-data.ts` — the paths for the 47 names in
`src/lib/icons.ts`, frozen into the package so nothing is fetched from api.iconify.design at
runtime. Both collections permit redistribution, and both require attribution:

- **Solar** by 480 Design — CC BY 4.0 (CC-BY-4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
- **Material Design Icons** by Pictogrammers — Apache 2.0 (Apache-2.0)
  https://github.com/Templarian/MaterialDesign/blob/master/LICENSE

`scripts/build-icons.ts` refuses to bundle a collection whose licence metadata it cannot read,
and `icon-data.test.ts` fails the build if a bundled collection is not credited here.

Any other typeface needs its licence recorded here before the files are committed, and
`src/lib/styles/fonts.test.ts` must keep passing — muse is distributed to every Facile app, so a
font added to this repo is a font redistributed thirteen times over.
